Package: clash-web
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), systemd, polkitd | policykit-1
Maintainer: Clash Web <clash-web@example.com>
Description: Web-based mihomo proxy management interface
 Clash Web provides a browser-based interface to manage mihomo
 (Clash Meta) proxy core. It supports subscription management,
 proxy node switching, traffic monitoring, and system proxy control.
Homepage: https://github.com/umbrella22/clash-web
